{"id":"u-426dcd1a-828e-4820-948d-42280c8d4f81","src":"community","title":"Cobra Kai Conditioning","author":"Blake B.","url":"https://www.boostcamp.app/users/HnXZUT-cobra-kai-conditioning","desc":"10 Week hybrid training program that is repeatable.\n\nWeeks 1-4 will focus on building muscle with three training sessions. Lower, Upper, and a Functional Full Body. This is also combined with 2 dedicated cardio days to continue building an aerobic base.\n\nAfter Phase 1 you deload.\n\nWeeks 6-9 focus on explosive power and raw strength. You’ll complete 3 training sessions focusing on Lower, Upper, and Full Body Explosive Power High Intensity Workout. Along with 2 Sprint based Workouts.\n\nWarm Up before Runs:\n• Lunge Rotations x10 each side\n\nWarm Up before Resistance Training:\n•10 min steady state cardio/incline walk\n•Worlds greatest stretch x12/ side\n•downward dog to plank stretch x10\n•arm circles x30\n\nDouble Progression for resistance exercises\nZone 2 endurance runs. Start with 20mins, increase 2-5 mins per week until you reach 45mins\n\nInterval runs: 2min run/ 1 min walk. Start with 8 rounds, slowly go up to 10\n\nSprint runs: 30 second sprints followed by 2minutes of walking. Start with 6 rounds, move up to 8.","level":["Intermediate","Beginner"],"goals":["Athletics","Muscle","Strength"],"equipment":["Full Gym"],"minutes":60,"joins":1,"rate":0,"rateCount":0,"updated":"2026-03-15T02:26:48.455Z","variations":[{"name":"default","days":["Lower Hypertrophy","Upper Hypertrophy","Endurance Day","Full Body Functional Strength","Interval Run"],"weeks":[[{"ex":[{"n":"Squat (Barbell)","sets":[{"lo":6,"hi":10,"rpe":8,"rpeHi":10,"x":3}]},{"n":"Trap Bar Deadlift","sets":[{"lo":6,"hi":10,"rpe":8,"rpeHi":10,"x":3}]},{"n":"Lying Leg Curl","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":12,"rpe":8,"x":3}]},{"ss":[{"n":"Plank","sets":[{"sec":60,"x":3}]},{"n":"Farmer's Walk (Weighted)","sets":[{"sec":30,"x":3}]}]},{"ss":[{"n":"Leg Extension","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":12,"rpe":8,"x":3}]},{"n":"Single Leg Calf